span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-04-29T10:29:21-07:00","id":1479714,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ashnak</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1479707-sc-2e-demigod-dominion#post1479707\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">[Submitted as errata also]<br /> So what's the deal with Dominion? Do I have Dominion over all of my Purviews when I hit Legend 5? Do I need to buy something extra?<br /> <br /> If I steal Giantsbane from Eric Donner as a Legend 5 Scion, can I suddenly control the weather (Sky Casual Miracle) even if I've never done anything with the Sky purview before?<br /> I looked through Kickstarter digital release and I can't see anything</div> </div> </div> </div>Based on what we were told during the Kickstarter having a Dominion requires a) being a Demigod and b) using two Boon slots (and you can reassign slots when you gain Legend, so you don\u2019t need to wait until you\u2019ve gained two empty ones).<br /> <br /> The fact that this is STILL not in the text has been reported in errata.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/18508